        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'ekyo hoona nabwo Yeroboamu tiyaahinduka kuruga omu muhanda gwe omubi, kureka yaataho abanyamurwa ahabw'egyo myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, naabaiha omu bandi bantu boona; ibara muntu owaabaire akunda, amushoroora kuba omunyamurwa e'egyo myanya. ",
